WEBVTT

00:00:01.044 --> 00:00:10.244
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.054 --> 00:00:21.254
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:30.734
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:37.194
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.314 --> 00:00:39.244
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.584 --> 00:00:43.534
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.284 --> 00:00:48.414
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.824 --> 00:00:52.624
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.294 --> 00:01:00.294
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:08.974
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.844 --> 00:01:15.974
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.184 --> 00:01:21.454
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.554 --> 00:01:24.614
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:38.604 --> 00:01:42.874
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:43.214 --> 00:01:46.664
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:46.784 --> 00:01:49.374
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:50.754 --> 00:01:54.484
Fuu, with the strength of her
heart that believed in her friends...

00:01:54.584 --> 00:01:58.854
...overcame Illusionist Caldina's plan
that pit them against themselves.

00:02:01.394 --> 00:02:05.294
Caldina, touched by
the hearts of Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu...

00:02:05.394 --> 00:02:10.994
...said she would pull herself
and Ascot away from further battles.

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:17.874
Hikaru, Umi, and Fuu's Unyielding Wish

00:03:01.054 --> 00:03:02.614
This monster's...

00:03:03.694 --> 00:03:05.924
...main body is here!

00:03:09.224 --> 00:03:10.194
Hikaru!

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:12.024
Flame...

00:03:15.034 --> 00:03:16.054
...Arrow!

00:03:16.704 --> 00:03:21.034
Water Dragon!

00:03:23.874 --> 00:03:26.864
Emerald Typhoon!

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:50.964
Umi. Fuu.

00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:53.244
Are you all right?

00:03:53.244 --> 00:03:54.764
Are you all right?
It's only a scratch.

00:03:54.874 --> 00:03:57.304
Are you all right, Ms. Hikaru?

00:03:57.414 --> 00:03:58.344
I'm fine!

00:03:59.984 --> 00:04:02.814
You are truly kind, Ms. Hikaru.

00:04:04.084 --> 00:04:07.214
It has been a while
since we arrived in Cephiro...

00:04:07.324 --> 00:04:12.814
...but you still worry about us with
a tearful look each time we get injured.

00:04:14.124 --> 00:04:15.094
Yeah.

00:04:15.524 --> 00:04:18.554
I'm glad that you look out for us...

00:04:18.664 --> 00:04:21.794
...but you have to take
care of yourself as well.

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:26.704
Hikaru?

00:04:28.974 --> 00:04:30.064
I...

00:04:31.644 --> 00:04:34.474
...don't want anyone to die anymore.

00:04:38.784 --> 00:04:39.874
Presea...

00:04:43.354 --> 00:04:45.324
I couldn't save her.

00:04:46.194 --> 00:04:48.214
I've been thinking lately.

00:04:48.324 --> 00:04:51.264
If I were able to grow
stronger more quickly...

00:04:51.964 --> 00:04:55.404
...Presea might not have
had to face all of that.

00:05:13.124 --> 00:05:16.554
Please become
the Magic Knights and save Cephiro...

00:05:20.164 --> 00:05:21.624
After that, Fuu...

00:05:21.724 --> 00:05:28.194
You did your best and cast Winds
of Healing over and over on Presea.

00:05:30.204 --> 00:05:32.104
My healing magic...

00:05:32.804 --> 00:05:35.904
...is unable to revive the dead.

00:05:39.344 --> 00:05:42.374
I couldn't do anything either.

00:05:43.854 --> 00:05:45.314
Magic Knights.

00:05:45.714 --> 00:05:49.624
I didn't feel like this
was another world at first.

00:05:50.394 --> 00:05:53.824
I just trudged along,
doing what I was told to do.

00:05:53.924 --> 00:05:57.384
After Clef told us
to become Magic Knights...

00:05:57.494 --> 00:05:59.964
...I wished that we could be them.

00:06:00.704 --> 00:06:04.324
But it was all out of
admiration and curiosity...

00:06:04.434 --> 00:06:07.204
It wasn't based on solid reasoning.

00:06:08.574 --> 00:06:12.844
But it's different now.
I want to become a Magic Knight!

00:06:14.214 --> 00:06:17.614
To fulfill the wishes
of Clef, Presea, Ferio...

00:06:17.714 --> 00:06:20.914
All the people who
helped us here in Cephiro.

00:06:21.654 --> 00:06:23.414
Become a Magic Knight...

00:06:25.824 --> 00:06:26.984
U-Umi.

00:06:30.034 --> 00:06:32.324
I'm glad you're here, Hikaru.

00:06:37.334 --> 00:06:40.674
I am very glad that I am
here with you, Ms. Hikaru.

00:06:41.344 --> 00:06:42.434
Hikaru...

00:06:43.574 --> 00:06:44.634
Mokona!

00:06:46.174 --> 00:06:49.114
You rush out as soon
as the battle is over.

00:06:52.884 --> 00:06:55.824
To think we have to keep traveling...

00:06:55.924 --> 00:06:58.854
...guided by this fluffy,
mischievous Mokona.

00:07:00.024 --> 00:07:03.014
We still have a ways
to go! Gotta do our best!

00:07:03.124 --> 00:07:04.924
Speaking of which...

00:07:05.034 --> 00:07:09.264
...how much longer must we
journey to become Magic Knights?

00:07:10.274 --> 00:07:12.204
Come to think of it...

00:07:13.134 --> 00:07:14.104
Mokona?

00:07:28.024 --> 00:07:29.114
This is...

00:07:31.124 --> 00:07:32.214
A map...

00:07:32.994 --> 00:07:34.424
...I take it?

00:07:37.194 --> 00:07:38.784
What's that light?

00:07:40.904 --> 00:07:42.124
I-It moved!

00:07:50.244 --> 00:07:51.334
Eterna?

00:07:52.944 --> 00:07:54.374
The Forest of...

00:07:55.644 --> 00:07:56.674
I know!

00:07:57.614 --> 00:07:59.384
This is us!

00:07:59.954 --> 00:08:02.314
This... You mean this map?

00:08:02.424 --> 00:08:04.514
No, this light!

00:08:05.694 --> 00:08:07.454
The Forest of Silence.

00:08:07.894 --> 00:08:09.654
The Spring of Eterna.

00:08:10.264 --> 00:08:12.094
Red, blue, green.

00:08:12.194 --> 00:08:15.064
It is symbolizing the three of us.

00:08:15.164 --> 00:08:19.104
And this line is the path
that we have traversed.

00:08:19.574 --> 00:08:21.004
I get it.

00:08:23.614 --> 00:08:26.344
The emblem on
the Water Shrine entrance.

00:08:26.444 --> 00:08:30.344
So that's the shrine
where the Rune-God was.

00:08:31.414 --> 00:08:34.314
We have traveled
through this much land.

00:08:36.154 --> 00:08:37.584
It moved again.

00:08:43.664 --> 00:08:45.964
And so we're here...

00:08:46.934 --> 00:08:50.864
To get a map displayed to us...
This feels like a video game.

00:08:51.404 --> 00:08:55.174
Legendary knights, armor
and weapons that evolve...

00:08:55.674 --> 00:08:58.764
It's totally like the world
of some role-playing game.

00:08:59.244 --> 00:09:02.004
Rescue the princess
and save the world.

00:09:02.344 --> 00:09:04.904
The story itself is very familiar.

00:09:07.454 --> 00:09:08.384
But...

00:09:09.354 --> 00:09:11.224
...this is reality.

00:09:11.324 --> 00:09:12.294
Yes.

00:09:17.064 --> 00:09:18.394
But, Mokona...

00:09:18.494 --> 00:09:22.664
If you could display a map,
why didn't you do it from the start?

00:09:26.374 --> 00:09:28.964
You were just reluctant to take it out?

00:09:30.214 --> 00:09:31.304
Mokona!

00:09:32.174 --> 00:09:33.444
Hey, Umi.

00:09:34.284 --> 00:09:36.374
What's a role-playing game?

00:09:37.514 --> 00:09:39.574
You do not know?

00:09:40.554 --> 00:09:41.524
No.

00:09:42.524 --> 00:09:45.284
Ms. Hikaru,
what about video games?

00:09:45.754 --> 00:09:47.594
Never played one.

00:09:47.694 --> 00:09:48.784
Not at all?

00:09:48.894 --> 00:09:49.864
Nope.

00:09:51.464 --> 00:09:52.864
Do you have siblings?

00:09:52.964 --> 00:09:54.164
Three brothers!

00:09:54.264 --> 00:09:56.254
And nobody plays video games?

00:09:56.334 --> 00:09:58.664
Our house runs a kendo dojo.

00:09:58.774 --> 00:10:02.674
So I get lessons with the students
or clean the dojo with them.

00:10:02.774 --> 00:10:07.804
I get it. So your tomboy
personality is thanks to your brothers.

00:10:07.914 --> 00:10:10.614
Oh, you practice kendo, Ms. Hikaru?

00:10:10.714 --> 00:10:12.984
I am on the archery team at school.

00:10:13.084 --> 00:10:15.744
I want to see you
in the archery team uniform!

00:10:15.984 --> 00:10:19.084
We have a match
coming soon. You must attend!

00:10:19.194 --> 00:10:19.924
I can? Yay!

00:10:19.924 --> 00:10:21.324
I can? Yay!
Of course!

00:10:21.424 --> 00:10:23.794
I'll invite you to my fencing meet too.

00:10:23.864 --> 00:10:24.794
Thanks!

00:10:24.864 --> 00:10:26.424
With that settled...

00:10:26.534 --> 00:10:30.494
...we should do our best
so we can go back to Tokyo soon!

00:10:30.804 --> 00:10:32.324
But before that...

00:10:33.744 --> 00:10:37.904
What is it, Fuu? Just when
we were all psyched up to go...

00:10:38.474 --> 00:10:41.674
We should heal our wounds
with Winds of Healing.

00:10:41.784 --> 00:10:42.674
I see.

00:10:42.744 --> 00:10:44.844
Mokona, let's get going!

00:10:48.724 --> 00:10:49.884
Mokona!

00:10:54.764 --> 00:10:57.854
Don't! You shouldn't
go so far away, Mokona!

00:11:06.574 --> 00:11:08.264
What was that light?

00:11:09.604 --> 00:11:11.444
Umi! Fuu!

00:11:11.544 --> 00:11:12.844
Umi!

00:11:14.314 --> 00:11:16.074
Fuu!

00:11:16.784 --> 00:11:20.584
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:21.954 --> 00:11:23.514
Umi!

00:11:23.894 --> 00:11:26.014
Fuu!

00:11:26.294 --> 00:11:28.084
Answer me!

00:11:28.694 --> 00:11:30.684
Umi!

00:11:32.564 --> 00:11:33.794
Fuu...

00:11:36.264 --> 00:11:37.364
What...

00:11:37.774 --> 00:11:39.734
What was that light?

00:11:40.374 --> 00:11:45.004
It looked like they were
absorbed into that light...

00:11:46.884 --> 00:11:47.814
Mokona!

00:11:48.184 --> 00:11:50.974
Do you know
what happened to them?

00:11:55.884 --> 00:11:56.984
Umi...

00:11:57.094 --> 00:11:58.214
Fuu...

00:12:01.064 --> 00:12:02.154
Mokona?

00:12:02.764 --> 00:12:03.724
Clef!

00:12:04.464 --> 00:12:05.434
Clef!

00:12:05.834 --> 00:12:07.664
Umi and Fuu were...

00:12:09.064 --> 00:12:10.664
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:12:11.204 --> 00:12:12.964
They were abducted!

00:12:13.674 --> 00:12:16.264
No, I think they were abducted...

00:12:16.944 --> 00:12:19.004
What do you mean?

00:12:19.114 --> 00:12:21.014
I don't know either.

00:12:21.114 --> 00:12:25.444
When I looked back, a wall of light
suddenly came toward them...

00:12:25.554 --> 00:12:27.814
...and swallowed up Umi and Fuu!

00:12:28.824 --> 00:12:30.444
A wall of light...

00:12:31.024 --> 00:12:32.924
Clef, do you know it?

00:12:33.564 --> 00:12:35.794
No, I've never heard of it.

00:12:35.894 --> 00:12:38.864
Not even you know
about this monster...

00:12:39.564 --> 00:12:41.504
The monsters I know...

00:12:42.334 --> 00:12:47.274
...make up only a fraction of all
the monsters that roam Cephiro today.

00:12:48.874 --> 00:12:51.964
Cephiro's monsters,
other than a few special cases...

00:12:52.074 --> 00:12:55.574
...are all manifestations
of the fear of the inhabitants.

00:12:56.384 --> 00:12:58.474
Manifestations of fear?

00:12:59.714 --> 00:13:04.654
Princess Emeraude supported
everything about this world with her will.

00:13:05.594 --> 00:13:07.824
She prays for
Cephiro to always be...

00:13:07.924 --> 00:13:10.864
...a peaceful place
where people can live at ease.

00:13:10.964 --> 00:13:15.624
Her heart was how Cephiro
was kept a fertile, beautiful land...

00:13:15.734 --> 00:13:18.294
...that lacked
abnormal weather patterns.

00:13:19.134 --> 00:13:23.594
However, she currently cannot
pray for the stability of Cephiro.

00:13:24.744 --> 00:13:28.234
That is why rain fills the skies,
and the earth cries out.

00:13:28.344 --> 00:13:32.474
Those natural disasters, along
with High Priest Zagato's treason...

00:13:32.584 --> 00:13:35.244
...further enveloped
the people in fear...

00:13:35.354 --> 00:13:39.154
...and those hearts
create new monsters.

00:13:39.254 --> 00:13:41.354
Then all those monsters...

00:13:57.974 --> 00:14:01.434
They are all
manifestations of the heart.

00:14:03.044 --> 00:14:04.314
The heart...

00:14:04.714 --> 00:14:09.274
Fear and terror in the heart
create all those monsters...

00:14:10.424 --> 00:14:14.684
I have no knowledge of the monster
that abducted Umi and Fuu.

00:14:16.824 --> 00:14:17.794
Clef!

00:14:19.334 --> 00:14:20.454
Clef...

00:14:20.864 --> 00:14:24.634
I feel like the time I can
talk to you is getting shorter...

00:14:32.314 --> 00:14:35.874
Clef is also fighting.
I have to do my best too.

00:14:35.984 --> 00:14:38.074
I'll find Umi and Fuu.

00:14:40.014 --> 00:14:42.284
It was a very fast monster.

00:14:42.554 --> 00:14:45.924
I have to first think
of how to catch up to it.

00:14:46.024 --> 00:14:51.394
But where in the world are Umi
and Fuu now? If only I knew where...

00:14:51.794 --> 00:14:52.824
That's right!

00:14:53.764 --> 00:14:56.134
That's right, Mokona! That map!

00:14:58.404 --> 00:14:59.334
S-Sorry.

00:15:00.104 --> 00:15:01.594
Yeah, that map!

00:15:01.704 --> 00:15:03.434
That map you showed us.

00:15:03.544 --> 00:15:06.914
I can figure out where
they are using that map!

00:15:10.384 --> 00:15:11.814
This is me.

00:15:12.214 --> 00:15:14.154
And this point that's moving...

00:15:15.054 --> 00:15:18.644
Mokona, do you know
which direction this light is moving?

00:15:24.064 --> 00:15:25.324
This way?

00:15:32.234 --> 00:15:33.764
Let's go, Mokona.

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:54.554
Umi...

00:15:54.664 --> 00:15:55.754
Fuu...

00:16:15.584 --> 00:16:18.514
You are truly kind, Ms. Hikaru.

00:16:19.214 --> 00:16:22.084
I'm glad that you look out for us...

00:16:22.184 --> 00:16:25.084
...but you have to take
care of yourself as well.

00:16:25.194 --> 00:16:28.094
Oh, you practice kendo, Ms. Hikaru?

00:16:28.194 --> 00:16:31.024
I am on the archery team at school.

00:16:31.134 --> 00:16:33.994
I'll invite you to my fencing meet too.

00:16:34.104 --> 00:16:37.864
We should do our best
so we can go back to Tokyo soon!

00:16:38.404 --> 00:16:39.394
Umi...

00:16:39.504 --> 00:16:40.564
Fuu...

00:16:41.074 --> 00:16:42.334
Wait for me...

00:16:42.444 --> 00:16:43.674
I will...

00:16:43.774 --> 00:16:44.934
I will...

00:16:45.774 --> 00:16:47.174
...come save you!

00:17:21.844 --> 00:17:23.784
I know I heard something...

00:17:27.424 --> 00:17:28.514
No...

00:17:34.424 --> 00:17:35.624
Mokona!

00:17:36.494 --> 00:17:38.894
Mokona!

00:17:51.644 --> 00:17:52.834
Umi...

00:17:53.644 --> 00:17:54.874
Fuu...

00:17:57.784 --> 00:17:58.944
Mokona!

00:18:01.154 --> 00:18:04.244
I have to save them.
Because we're...

00:18:06.224 --> 00:18:08.314
...going back to Tokyo together.

00:18:08.424 --> 00:18:10.194
We'll become Magic Knights...

00:18:10.294 --> 00:18:13.064
...and the three of us
will return to Tokyo together!

00:18:13.164 --> 00:18:15.424
I decided that for myself.

00:18:15.534 --> 00:18:17.734
I promised Umi and Fuu.

00:18:18.604 --> 00:18:20.294
And I refuse...

00:18:21.274 --> 00:18:23.244
...to break my promise!

00:18:24.474 --> 00:18:25.404
So...

00:18:26.114 --> 00:18:27.944
So no matter what...

00:18:28.044 --> 00:18:32.674
...the three of us are
gonna become Magic Knights!

00:18:39.254 --> 00:18:40.584
That light...

00:18:41.224 --> 00:18:44.024
Why did it go after Umi and Fuu?

00:18:45.664 --> 00:18:48.224
Does it go after moving objects?

00:18:55.774 --> 00:18:56.744
No...

00:18:57.514 --> 00:19:00.534
I was moving back then too...

00:19:10.224 --> 00:19:13.554
Just before,
when Mokona covered me...

00:19:14.124 --> 00:19:15.854
...I wasn't moving.

00:19:17.694 --> 00:19:22.324
Between them back then and me
now, what do we have in common?

00:19:22.634 --> 00:19:24.034
What is it?

00:19:27.444 --> 00:19:28.534
Blood!

00:19:29.244 --> 00:19:33.834
Back then,
Umi and Fuu were bleeding...

00:19:34.644 --> 00:19:36.744
And how I am now...

00:19:37.514 --> 00:19:38.604
Then it...

00:19:39.714 --> 00:19:43.284
It'll come to me, attracted by blood!

00:19:53.694 --> 00:19:54.794
This way.

00:19:56.564 --> 00:19:57.764
Come on!

00:20:20.324 --> 00:20:21.484
Flame...

00:20:23.164 --> 00:20:26.294
...Arrow!

00:20:51.154 --> 00:20:52.414
This monster...

00:20:55.524 --> 00:20:58.014
...is a creation of the heart?

00:21:03.164 --> 00:21:04.134
Ms. Hikaru!

00:21:04.134 --> 00:21:05.394
Ms. Hikaru!
Hikaru!

00:21:05.504 --> 00:21:07.474
How did you get hurt?

00:21:07.574 --> 00:21:10.544
What has happened?
Was it another monster?

00:21:13.144 --> 00:21:15.634
It was reckless to fight alone.

00:21:16.514 --> 00:21:18.104
I wasn't alone.

00:21:20.924 --> 00:21:25.584
Because Umi and Fuu were
with me, I was able to do my best!

00:21:25.694 --> 00:21:27.314
I'm not alone!

00:21:27.424 --> 00:21:28.684
Ms. Hikaru...

00:21:29.164 --> 00:21:32.794
Let's make sure the three of us
become Magic Knights together...

00:21:32.894 --> 00:21:34.834
...and that we save Cephiro!

00:21:35.564 --> 00:21:36.534
Yes.

00:21:36.934 --> 00:21:38.024
Hikaru...

00:21:42.644 --> 00:21:46.234
And let's go back to Tokyo together!

00:21:47.374 --> 00:21:48.344
Yes.

00:21:49.284 --> 00:21:51.404
Winds of Healing!

00:22:00.224 --> 00:22:01.314
Let's go.

00:22:01.924 --> 00:22:04.894
To revive the next Rune-God!

00:22:26.784 --> 00:22:31.184
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.754 --> 00:22:38.354
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.794 --> 00:22:45.364
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.104 --> 00:22:49.934
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.244 --> 00:22:55.404
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.614 --> 00:22:58.044
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.154 --> 00:23:02.954
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.984 --> 00:23:10.624
